<title>FINLAND: ASKO'S UPONOR SAYS WINS FIM 50 MLN ORDER.</title>
<headline>ASKO'S UPONOR SAYS WINS FIM 50 MLN ORDER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish furniture, plastic pipes and white goods maker Asko's Uponor plastic pipes unit said on Tuesday it had won a 50 million markka gas pipe deal from Irish gas utility Bord Gais Eireann.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal, with a value of about 50 million markka, is a continuation of an earlier contract,&quot; Uponor said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
